  "acceptanceScope": "Home aperture native material, round-opening/thin-upper/heavy-curved-lower casting interpretation, venue mask, emblem fit, physical rail registration and sport colour preservation in the frozen final runtime. Whole-release and latest-source aesthetic decisions remain with root and the visual director.",
  "findingsResolved": [
    "The former nearly uniform circular casting and separate slab pedestal are replaced with a thin upper crown and one continuous heavy curved lower body. Native centre-column opaque material bands are131pixels above the opening versus291pixels below, a2.22x lower casting depth.",
    "Royal/navy optical glass retains localized intense white-blue cores and polished/brushed steel detail, with no broad cyan wash, illustrated silver stroke or external white box halo.",
    "Native1315x1197RGBA housing is used without resizing or upscaling; delivery WebP exactly preserves original dimensions and alpha. Actual housing density is3.507x on393 and3.223x on430, exceeding the DPR2 captures.",
    "Measured closed physical light paths align with the actual recessed glass; runner hooks keep pathLength1000. Main and metal runner offsets advance continuously and wrap during natural time in the completed reports.",
    "The round opening is filled throughout by the measured native-alpha venue mask, without black hairlines, scene spill, distorted photographs or visible alpha fringe in any of16phone originals.",
    "Final NFL and NRL emblem sizing improves source density while remaining sharp, proportional and separated from inner chrome. NBA has clear upper and lower clearance; UFC fits within the stadium window.",
    "Housing-only selective recolouring preserves neutral chrome in the NRL environment and removes the former pink/magenta metal reflection; NBA remains blue-left/red-right and UFC ruby.",
    "All four14CSS-pixel sparkle neighborhoods remain on opaque neutral metal surfaces outside the opening and logos. Natural reflection samples do not obscure control labels.",
    "Both native engines pass45actions at each phone size, including NFL entry, protected onward/back routes, direct loads and refresh. All error arrays are empty; reduced-motion stops infinite effects and returning to normal motion resumes them.",
    "Runtime, capture helpers and original protected tests remain unchanged during both completed and closed final browser runs."
  ],
